  "spec_sync_policy": "Every current-state claim must identify an exact source HEAD and workflow run. Historical diagnostic evidence remains immutable and must not be promoted to current-main verification. Flight diagnostics dashboard acceptance is defined in spec/Flight-Diagnostics-大屏设计规范.md and enforced by G13. Flight radio transmitter visualization acceptance is defined in spec/Flight-Radio-可视化设计规范.md and enforced by G14. Flight radio dual-gimbal live-monitor acceptance is defined in spec/Flight-Radio-可视化设计规范.md and enforced by G14. Flight radio acceptance explicitly exercises Mode 1, Mode 2 and Mode 3 with two distinct RC_CHANNELS frames, centre return and per-stick invalid-channel handling.",
